Vibhīṣaṇa bids Lakṣmaṇa break vast army before rite ends --- Lakṣmaṇa showers arrows on Rāvaṇa son --- Bears and monkeys charge with trees and peaks --- Demons resist with swords and spears spreading terror --- Unfinished Indrajit rises angry and mounts ready chariot --- Hanumān lifts tree and burns demon army --- Thousands shower weapons on mountainlike Hanumān --- Indrajit drives at Hanumān raining swords and darts --- Hanumān catches weapons and challenges him to duel --- Vibhīṣaṇa marks Vāsava conqueror and urges Lakṣmaṇa to kill
